TITLE 1 kg pure water at 150C equilibrated with fixed-pressure gas mix; compute SI for N2(g)
SOLUTION 1
    temp 150
    pH 7
    pe 4
    units mol/kgw
    water 1
GAS_PHASE 1
    -fixed_pressure
    -pressure 1
    -temperature 150
    CH4(g)  0.4 10
    CO2(g)  0.4 10
    NH3(g)  0.2 5
SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -reset false
    -high_precision true
    -si N2(g)
END
